     1,
     "<div>Hello,</div><div><br></div><div>i am trying to figure out if or how I can compare two nested models with multiple imputed datasets. I used sem.mi ti compute the models. Of course I can comapre the pooled fit indicies, but is there a possibility to compare models like the anova() function does? <br></div><div>I thought about the lavtestLRT.mi function but could not figure it out.<br></div><div><br></div><div>I am thankful for any tipps on this matter. Thanks a lot,</div><div>Jacquelin <br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
